[
  {
    "name": "azul_maps_desktop_panel_search_place_way",
    "description": "AzMaps on a desktop, 1280 x 800: the map fills the window, the panel at the left (search, chips, then the results, the place, the way), the zoom, locate and map-style keys at the right. Pictures, in order: 1 first look, 2 the results of 'Stuttgart', 3 the place, 3b Share (the notice that the link is on the clipboard), 4 the way (Route), 5 a chip's search, 6 dark, 7 the panel folded away to its search key, 8 the settings page (the gear). (The map styles' popover is a window of its own: the host's picture is of the main window, so no step opens it.)",
